        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">average production comprising the following steps: core mounting; epxoy-curing; winding; welding; molding; marking; bending; testing and final control.\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used ring core choke type inductors.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
